# =============================================================================
# .graphifyignore — graph-tooling exclusions (gitignore syntax)
#
# Authority: Phase 1-5 Graph Remediation Track (FreeBuf governance)
# Rationale: docs/standards/graph-hygiene-and-exclusions.md
#
# NOTE (tool semantics, verified): .graphifyignore patterns can only ever
# exclude MORE, never re-include a .gitignore-excluded path.
# =============================================================================

# --- R-1: vendored skill bundles (immutable third-party tree) ----------------
# Phase 3 proved these are an intentional upstream bundle mirror layout
# (src/ = only source of truth; cli/assets/ + .claude/skills/ = synced copies).
# Indexing them produced 12,411 'ui-ux-pro-max' node refs and all
# duplicate-name false positives for core.py / design_system.py / validate_data.py.
.claude/skills/**

# --- R-2: generated graph output (never a source of truth) -------------------
graphify-out/

# --- R-3: local runtime volumes / state (already .gitignore'd; belt-and-braces)
local/volumes/
local/local/
*.log
logs/

# --- R-4: dependency + build artifacts --------------------------------------
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# --- R-5: OS / editor noise --------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.idea/
.vscode/
